{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130980/extras/c26463986882295fa940c2156fa80ee9.poster.avif?t=1772639780\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130980/extras/c26463986882295fa940c2156fa80ee9.webm?t=1772639780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130980/extras/c26463986882295fa940c2156fa80ee9.mp4?t=1772639780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>About This Game</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapted from the novel &quot;The Secret of Room 207&quot; in the form of an anomaly.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors speak of a mysterious room hidden inside an old hotel\u2026\u00a0 A room that can bring back what was once lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has lost something more precious than life itself\u2026\u00a0 With nothing left to lose, he enters <strong>Room 7</strong>,<br>hoping for one last chance to restore what was taken from him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Everything has a price. .. A price he must pay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you are trapped inside a repeating loop.<br>Find your way out\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >before the room consumes you and turns you into one of its anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130980/extras/7e1d2bd725fafd3a6e0839e65ad06b3d.poster.avif?t=1772639780\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130980/extras/7e1d2bd725fafd3a6e0839e65ad06b3d.webm?t=1772639780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130980/extras/7e1d2bd725fafd3a6e0839e65ad06b3d.mp4?t=1772639780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gameplay Mechanics:-</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror game focused on detecting <strong>anomalies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you <strong>don\u2019t</strong> see an anomaly \u2192 go to the <strong>right door</strong> or the <strong>green door</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you <strong>do</strong> see an anomaly \u2192 go to the <strong>left door</strong> or the <strong>red door</strong> (if present)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful\u2026 a single mistake may lead to death or Imprison you forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes simple <strong>puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some <strong>items</strong> can be collected and used</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130980/extras/1759de9e715ca94be4c28034946543d6.poster.avif?t=1772639780\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130980/extras/1759de9e715ca94be4c28034946543d6.webm?t=1772639780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130980/extras/1759de9e715ca94be4c28034946543d6.mp4?t=1772639780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short but intense horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized anomalies \u2014 every loop feels different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person perspective for full immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark atmosphere inspired by cursed hotel legends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick decisions under pressure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4130980?t=1772639780","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4130980?t=1772639780","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130980/d73450b8907f56ed96c1ab8291daf06c23bedb61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772639780","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130980/d73450b8907f56ed96c1ab8291daf06c23bedb61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772639780","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130980/extras/c26463986882295fa940c2156fa80ee9.poster.avif?t=1772639780\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130980/extras/c26463986882295fa940c2156fa80ee9.webm?t=1772639780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130980/extras/c26463986882295fa940c2156fa80ee9.mp4?t=1772639780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>About This Game</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapted from the novel &quot;The Secret of Room 207&quot; in the form of an anomaly.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors speak of a mysterious room hidden inside an old hotel\u2026\u00a0 A room that can bring back what was once lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has lost something more precious than life itself\u2026\u00a0 With nothing left to lose, he enters <strong>